  <h1>Cold Brew Bag In Box Coffee</h1>
  <p>Bag in box coffee is boxed cold brew: a convenient, ready-to-pour cold coffee or tea, with no steeping or brewing hassle. The coffee concentrate comes in a fridge-friendly box with a tap, in a fridge format for wholesale and for home.</p>

  <h2>Why choose bag in box?</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Ready to pour cold coffee or tea</li>
    <li>No steeping or brewing hassle</li>
    <li>Fridge-friendly box with a tap</li>
    <li>Consistency in every pour</li>
    <li>Lower preparation and less waste</li>
    <li>Suits multiple serving occasions</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Bag in Box versus cold brew in kegs</h2>
  <p>Kegs serve nitro cold brew on tap through a dispenser or kegerator, while the bag in box is a simple fridge format that needs no dispensing equipment. See <a href="/kegerators/">equipment to serve nitro cold brew coffee</a>.</p>

  <p>Browse the <a href="/products/">Bag in Box and keg products</a>, order on the <a href={commerceHref('webstore-root-www')}>webstore</a>, or see <a href="/howtobuy/">how to buy</a> wholesale.</p>
